NetHack 5.0 is building nearly completely unmodified.

Step 1:
copy plan9-apexp to sys/unix/hints in your NetHack source directory

Step 2:
in APExp, cd to your NetHack source directory
cd sys/unix
sh setup.sh hints/plan9-apexp

Step 3:
cd ../.. (to the root of NetHack)
make all

Source changes:
Some minimal source changes needed (for now), see diff
